  "description": "Variation for condition 1 (Plans) pursuant to planning permission  15/02742/FUL dated 14/10/2016 for 'Demolition of existing buildings at 83/83A Winnington Road and erection of new dwelling and associated works'. Variation include changes to internal layout to all levels and widening of proposed building. New rear lightwell with emergency staircase and removal of proposed skylights. Introduction of rear bays and relocation of garden pavilion at ground floor level. Introduction of off-street parking to the front of the site and relocation of car stacker. Proposed new rear balcony and rear bay to master suite at first floor level and proposed double dormer configuration at second floor level. Reduction of side windows to both sides. Raising of ridge line, removal of chimney stack and parapet and other associated changes to roof. Changes to front elevation including Provision of Dutch gable front entrance, changes to metal balustrade and changes to windows. Associated changes including changes to garden pavilion.",
